    <cc:aboutCensorshipEvent rdf:resource="http://example.org/censorcreate#EV_HKR_DistributionStop"/>
    <cc:confidenceLevel>high</cc:confidenceLevel>
    <cc:claimText>Distribution was stopped on 10 September 1985 (agent not named in the source); Höpcke was 'called on the carpet and given a formal censure'. No documented creative response to this second event.</cc:claimText>
